&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;The Company You’ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Carta is the connected platform and AI-native ecosystem for private capital. Built to replace fragmented tools with a single system of record, Carta brings together the software, services, and legal infrastructure that founders use to manage equity, fund managers use to run administration and reporting, and legal teams use to close transactions. Trusted by 55,000 companies and 1.8M+ equity holders in 160+ countries, and 10,000 funds and SPVs representing $250B+ in assets under management, Carta is transforming how private capital operates. Recognized by Fortune, Forbes, Fast Company, Inc. and Great Places to Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about our offices and culture, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://carta.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Carta careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Work With&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll be joining our Carta Law team, specifically within the Contracts - APAC function.&lt;br&gt;Our Contracts team manages the full lifecycle of commercial contracts for clients – from first&lt;br&gt;review through to execution. You&#39;ll be the direct day-to-day contact for sophisticated&lt;br&gt;investment fund and asset manager clients, working alongside fellow lawyers and paralegals.&lt;br&gt;This team delivers high volumes of pre-M&amp;amp;A contract work at speed, supported by AI-&lt;br&gt;backed tools including Carta&#39;s proprietary platform, Ava.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Problems You&#39;ll Solve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Carta, our employees set out on a mission to unlock the power of equity ownership for&lt;br&gt;more people in more places. We believe that the problems we solve today unlock the&lt;br&gt;opportunities of tomorrow. As a Freelance Consultant on the Contracts team, you&#39;ll work to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and manage high volumes of pre-M&amp;amp;A contracts – including NDAs,&lt;br&gt;confidentiality agreements, NRLs, joinders, and engagement letters – directly liaising&lt;br&gt;with counterparties and adhering to agreed turnaround times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary day-to-day contact for clients, building trusted advisor&lt;br&gt;relationships with sophisticated investment funds and asset managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update client playbooks on an ongoing basis, ensuring consistency and&lt;br&gt;quality across all contract negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with and mentor junior lawyers and paralegals, reviewing their work and&lt;br&gt;contributing to a high-performing team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of Carta&#39;s legal technology suite,&lt;br&gt;identifying ways to innovate using AI-backed tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;About You&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded and client-focused. You communicate legal advice crisply&lt;br&gt;and concisely, building strong relationships with sophisticated financial services&lt;br&gt;clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in transactional law. 6-8+ PQE, with a track record of independently&lt;br&gt;negotiating pre-M&amp;amp;A contracts (NDAs, NRLs, joinders, engagement letters).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with financial services. You have experience working with asset managers,&lt;br&gt;investment banks, or other financial services firms and understand their expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Degree and licensed to practice. You are licensed to practice law in any APAC&lt;br&gt;Jurisdiction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be based in APAC time zone, due to our client service needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy and adaptable. You are comfortable working with and evolving a legal&lt;br&gt;technology suite (e.g. AI tools, HighQ), and an interest in legal tech or AI is a strong&lt;br&gt;plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who owns their work. You thrive in a fast-paced environment,&lt;br&gt;prioritize effectively, and are always looking for ways to improve and innovate.&lt;br&gt;Compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation for the role will be paid on a fixed per-document basis, details of which will&lt;br&gt;be discussed during the first screening call with our Talent Team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Disclosures:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to providing a positive interview experience for every candidate. If accommodations due to a disability or medical condition are needed, please connect with the talent partner via email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carta uses E-Verify in the United States for employment authorization. See the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot;&gt;E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;Department&quot;&gt;Department of Justice&lt;/a&gt; websites for more details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For information on our data privacy policies, see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/privacy/candidate/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;CA Candidate Privacy&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://carta.com/legal/br/brazil-pay-transparency/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Brazil Transparency Report&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that all official communications from us will come from an @carta.com or @carta-external.com domain. Report any contact from unapproved domains to security@carta.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
